<h1>Monthly quota reached</h1>
<p>Hi {{name}},</p>
<p>Your <strong>{{plan}}</strong> quota of <strong>{{limit}} requests</strong> is exhausted for this month.</p>

<div class="highlight">
  <p style="margin:0;font-size:14px;color:#fca5a5;">✗ &nbsp;Live gateway calls are currently returning <span class="code">402 quota_exceeded</span>.</p>
</div>

<p>Your options:</p>
<p>1. &nbsp;<a href="{{billingUrl}}" style="color:#a78bfa;">Upgrade to Pro</a> — 30,000 requests/month</p>
<p>2. &nbsp;<a href="{{billingUrl}}" style="color:#a78bfa;">Enable pay-as-you-go</a> — $0.001/req overage</p>
<p>3. &nbsp;Wait for quota reset on the 1st of next month</p>

<p style="text-align:center;margin:24px 0;">
  <a class="btn" href="{{billingUrl}}">Manage Billing</a>
</p>
